;VIACtrlB1
Mode:@MODE@, Value:@VALUE@ (PE:@POSEDGE@, NE:@NEGEDGE@)
#---
#---
;VIACtrlB2
Mode:@MODE@, Value:@VALUE@ (PE:@POSEDGE@, NE:@NEGEDGE@)
