;VIATimer1
Run Mode:@RUN@, Count Mode:@COUNT@
IRQ:@IRQ@
Value:@VALUE@(@INITIALVALUE@)
#---
#---
;VIATimer2
Run Mode:@RUN@, Count Mode:@COUNT@
IRQ:@IRQ@
Value:@VALUE@(@INITIALVALUE@)
#---
#---
;VIAShiftReg
Mode:@MODE@
Value:@VALUE@ (@NUMBERBITS@)
#---
#---
;VIAPort
Output Register:@OR@
Input Register:@IR@
Direction Register:@DDR@
Pins:@Port@
#---
