;CIAClock
IRQ:@Interrupt@
@HOURS@:@MINUTES@:@SECONDS@:@TENTHSECONDS@ (@AHOURS@:@AMINUTES@:@ASECONDS@:@ATENTHSECONDS@)
#---
;CIATimerA
Run Mode:@RUN@, Count Mode:@COUNT@
Active:@STATUS@, IRQ:@IRQ@
Value:@VALUE@(@INITIALVALUE@)
#---
#---
;CIATimerB
Run Mode:@RUN@, Count Mode:@COUNT@
Active:@STATUS@, IRQ:@IRQ@
Value:@VALUE@(@INITIALVALUE@)
