#---
;SerialIOSimulationDefinition
LATTABLE:$@LATTABLE@,FATTABLE:$@FATTABLE@,SATTABLE:$@SATTABLE@
DFLTN:$@DFLTN@,DFLTO:$@DFLTO@
->Traps:
@TRAPS?{key=no,equal=,empty=no trap}\n@
