;CVICIIEVENTS
Legend:
Light Cyan: Positive edge vertical border (on)
Light Yellow: Negative edge vertical border (off)
Light Orange: Positive edge main border (on)
Light Purple: Negative edge main border (off)
Light Green: Badline
